        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b873e2522241447aa0c74289168a77ff",
      "statement": "The MongoDB replica-set keyfile is carried as an ordinary env value (`MONGO_MC_KEYFILE`, minted as single-line base64) and materialized at start-up into a `0400` in-container file by `mc-service/mongo-entrypoint.sh`, preserving the no-host-file-secret model.",
