    {
      "id": "claim_5877f83dbf6e4620a5818531469539ea",
      "statement": "`scripts/check-topology-scrub.mjs` is the tree-wide gate that keeps a real tailnet host out of any committed file, matching `*.ts.net` FQDNs and allowing only sanitized placeholders (those containing `tailnet` or `example`) — which is why a registry host cannot appear in a committed template.",
